																		Artist Commentary
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alistair-hawks" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4544281); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4544281&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608973987" alt="Alistair Hawks" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4544281)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alistair-hawks" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4544281); return false;" >Alistair Hawks</a></span> <span class="odate time_1540959205 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">31 Oct 2018 04:13</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4045236">
									

<p>I have posted something??? On the Wiki??? Who knew that this day would come! Special thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3487700); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1561769220" alt="Uncle Nicolini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3487700); return false;">Uncle Nicolini</a></span> for helping me out with the initial coding (as I’m so dang new to this site), and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rounderhouse" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4187885); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4187885&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1561769220" alt="Rounderhouse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4187885)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rounderhouse" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4187885); return false;">Rounderhouse</a></span> for giving me further coding ideas. He was the one who suggested me to use the collapsibles created by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrpines" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2241229); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2241229&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1561769221" alt="MrPines" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2241229)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrpines" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2241229); return false;">MrPines</a></span>.</p>
<p>Thank you <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrpines" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2241229); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2241229&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1561769221" alt="MrPines" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2241229)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrpines" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2241229); return false;">MrPines</a></span> for cleaning up the code and adding the image zoom feature.</p>
<p>Thank you <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/woedenaz" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1404096); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1404096&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1561769221" alt="Woedenaz" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1404096)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/woedenaz" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1404096); return false;">Woedenaz</a></span> for allowing me to both use his CSS and having him fix it to work with the already existing CSS.</p>
<p>I hope you enjoy my art!</p>
<p>Dec 27th 2018: haha yes, 69 upgamers at last!</p>
<p>June 38th 2019: yessss 100 upvotes! Thank you Laneous for being the 100th vote!</p>

							</div>

								
